      "id": "DSG-01",
      "chapter": "inputs",
      "title": "Injecting classes into signatures of real elements modulo unit signatures",
      "anchor": "inputs-dyadic-signatures",
      "statement": "For a cyclotomic CM layer L of conductor f·2ⁿ with f odd, f>1 and n≥2, write K=ker(1+J) and D=im(1−J) on its ordinary ideal class group, V for all conjugation-even bit patterns on embeddings, and S for signatures of J-fixed units. There is an injection of sets K/D → V/S.",
